+## Flag
+Recommended new flag `QUARRY_EDGE__SCRAPE_MAX_AGE=on|off`, default OFF (owner decision whether to ship default-on since it is opt-in per request and absent-key behaviour is unchanged). Redis required (state.cache is None without REDIS_URL: then `max_age` yields cache_state bypass plus warning `cache_unavailable`, never an error). `QUARRY_EDGE__SCRAPE_OPTIONS_ENABLED=0` (kill switch for option keys) must also disable `max_age`; `QUARRY_EDGE__SCRAPE_REQUEST_VALIDATION=strict` interacts (max_age stops being an unknown key). No live flag touched.
