+- C3, the person sub-cap of 6: not asked; unit tests only.
+- The 4 h backstop at its real value: the same code path ran with the value shortened to 150 s (S7).
+- A WebSocket frames viewer for `close_run` (S6): an SSE events viewer was used; the guard is the same.
