+# L-SC5-SC6-docs-zdr (live dev stack)
+
+- Leg: L-SC5-SC6-docs-zdr. SC6 (documents and media through `/v1/scrape`), the one-org parts of SC5 (ZDR scrape, no artifacts, no URL or title in the edge log), and the X-19 receipts evidence (runbook 3.4).
+- Time window UTC: 2026-10-28 20:38 to 20:50.
+- Code that runs: main + integration 7c082825a (live checkout `C:\dev\CoresSystem`, quarry-edge image rebuilt 19:45 UTC). `GET /version` says revision "unverified" on live.
+- Identity: the dev stub only (`Bearer dev-evidence` becomes org_placeholder / user_placeholder, principal user). No real token.
+- Helper: `qlive-helper-docs` (nginx:alpine on network `crawl-fixture`, aliases `docs.qlive.crawl.test` and `forms.qlive.crawl.test`). Files: `fixture.pdf` (text "QLIVE PDF FIXTURE"), `fixture.docx` ("QLIVE DOCX FIXTURE"), `fixture.png` (1x1), `fixture.zip`, `login.html` (a text box, a password input, a submit button and a search box). Removed at the end. The files were made with `python mk.py` (in the scratchpad), not with any secret.
+- Flags changed and reverted (all in `flags-log.md`): `DOC_ROUTING=on` (SC6), `RUST_LOG=debug` (ZDR log scan, worst case), `RECEIPT_TEXT_MODE=all` (X-19 second leg). The receipts "switch" of runbook 3.4 is `QUARRY_EDGE__REDACTION_MODE`: it was `enforce` (the default, not changed) and the edge logged `secret redaction active ... enforce`, `receipt text policy set: sensitive` and `step receipts: Postgres (durable, tenant-bound)` at boot, so no flag was needed for leg 1. At the end `live-flags.env` is empty (0 bytes), the edge was recreated at 20:47 UTC and is healthy, and `live.sh flags` is identical to `P0-live-flags-end.txt` (file `L-SC5-SC6-docs-zdr-flags-end.txt`, `diff` empty). `RUST_LOG` is `info`, `DOC_ROUTING` and `RECEIPT_TEXT_MODE` are not set, `METRICS_ENABLED` is 0 as in the baseline.
+- Runs: every agent run was closed (each close answered 200; `/ready` at the end: `sessions_open` 0). Run ids: x19 human `run_01M6241PR23P928D0AMPHZRWBC`, agent first try `run_01M624384EYGK7T45EWY62YPH8`, agent `run_01M6244QB9BP7JD3TBFDYVKZY0` and `run_01M6245T66J8CBCKC1V60V7XRJ`, all-mode `run_01M6247R7V2B65CYH77PZRRX30`, ZDR agent `run_01M6240HY3NMTY73QHB3MGMJ3F`.
